'''Vileplume''' (Japanese: '''ラフレシア''' ''Ruffresia'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

