==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Vileplume|43}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Vileplume}}.
*'''Soothing Scent''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Genesis|Meganium|11}} from the {{TCG|Neo Genesis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

